From: blester <blester@oreon>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] TST: pie logscale warning via pytest.warns

assert_produces_warning finally can hide the real plot error and is stacklevel-brittle

--- a/pandas/tests/plotting/frame/test_frame.py
+++ b/pandas/tests/plotting/frame/test_frame.py
@@ -371,7 +371,7 @@
             df.plot(**{input_param: "sm"})
 
         msg = f"PiePlot ignores the '{input_param}' keyword"
-        with tm.assert_produces_warning(UserWarning, match=msg):
+        with pytest.warns(UserWarning, match=msg):
             df.plot.pie(subplots=True, **{input_param: True})
 
     def test_xcompat(self):
